   "fen": "r1bqk2r/pp2bppp/2np1n2/2p1p3/2B1P2N/2NP4/PPP2PPP/R1BQ1RK1 b kq - 8 9",
   "line": [
    "Nh4"
   ],
   "spoken": "And Topalov played the surprising novelty, a knight to h4.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
